# Video generation backends (lib/video/backends/) — all optional.
# Copy to .env and export before running `npm run generate:video`
# (tsx does not auto-load .env; use `export $(cat .env | xargs)` or a shell profile).

# Pollinations — OPTIONAL. Free models run keyless with no key at all.
# A key (from https://enter.pollinations.ai) unlocks premium video models
# billed in Pollen credits.
# POLLINATIONS_API_KEY=

# Magic Hour — free 400 credits on signup + 100/day claimable in the web
# app. Key from the Developer dashboard at https://magichour.ai.
# MAGIC_HOUR_API_KEY=

# Luma Dream Machine — PAID, no free API tier. Key from https://lumalabs.ai/api.
# Same env var name as Luma's official SDKs.
# LUMAAI_API_KEY=
